{"abstract":"Dødeligheden af hjertesygdom er mere end halveret de seneste tre årtier, ogantallet af blodpropper i hjertet er faldende. Statiner har spillet en afgørende rolle idenne udvikling.","author_count":30,"contributors":["Gislason, Gunnar","Lassen, Jens Flensted","Zwisler, Ann Dorthe Olsen","Gislasson, Gunnar","Erik Bøtker, Hans","Hassager, Christian","Kristensen, Steen Dalby","Søgaard, Peter","Olsen, Michael Hecht","Nielsen, Jens Cosedis","Høj Christensen, Evald","Juhl Terkelsen, Christian","Jensen, Henrik Kjærulf","Böttker, Morten","Svendsen, Jesper Hastrup","Iversen, Kasper","Schou, Morten","Lav Madsen, Per","Biering-Sørensen, Tor","Diederichsen, Axel Cosmus Pyndt","Brandes, Axel","Engstrøm, Thomas","Hansen, Jacob Tfelt","Kofoed, Klaus F","Køber, Lars Valeur","Møller, Jacob Eifer","Mæng, Michael","Riahi, Sam","Folke, Fredrik","Sajadieh, Ahmad"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-831615"],"filters":{"added":"2025-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-NP","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR"],"NP":["DI-NP-ALL","DI-NP-HJER"],"OT":["Department of Medico Engineering"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-NP-HJER","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"statiner redder liv men skræmmekampagnerrisikerer at koste dem","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dna","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-831615","ids":["sdu-ef800eb4-cebf-4c48-b7ed-a36d17b864cc"],"lang":"English","level":"Popular","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-B5C5607D3F16E53462359F8606EC40AB"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of 