{"abstract":"AIMS: The aims of this study were to investigate the correlation and sex differences between total valve calcium, valve calcium concentration, and aortic valve calcification (AVC) in explanted valves from patients with severe aortic valve stenosis undergoing aortic valve replacement (AVR). METHODS AND RESULTS: Sixty-nine patients with severe aortic stenosis (AS) scheduled for elective AVR underwent echocardiography and cardiac computed tomography (CT) prior to surgery (AVCin vivo) and CT of the explanted aortic valve (AVCex vivo). Explanted valves were prepared in acid solution, sonicated, and analysed with Arsenazo III dye to estimate total valve calcium and valve calcium concentration. Median AVCex vivo was 2082 (1421-2973) AU; mean valve calcium concentration was 1.43 ± 0.42 µmol Ca2+/mg tissue; median total valve calcium 156 (111-255) mg Ca2+, and valve calcium density 52 (35-81) mg/cm2. AVC displayed a strong correlation with total valve calcium (R2 = 0.98, P < 0.001) and a moderate correlation with valve calcium concentration (R2 = 0.62, P < 0.001). Valvular calcium concentration was associated with sex, aortic valve area, and mean gradient. After adjusting for age and estimated glomerular filtration rate, sex and mean gradient remained associated with valve calcium concentrations. CONCLUSION: AVC score provides a strong estimate for total valve calcium but to a lesser degree calcium concentration in the valve tissue of patients with severe AS. Females presented lower valvular calcium concentrations than males irrespective of AS severity, adding evidence and providing support to the important point that sex differences in valvular calcium concentration in AS does not reflect valvular size.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Linde, Louise","Carter-Storch, Rasmus","Christensen, Nicolaj Lyhne","Øvrehus, Kristian Altern","Diederichsen, Axel Cosmus Pyndt","Laursen, Kristian","Jensen, Pia Søndergaard","Rasmussen, Lars Melholt","Møller, Jacob Eifer","Dahl, Jordi Sanchez"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-620473"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Linde, Louise"],"keyword":["Aortic Valve Stenosis","Aortic valve calcification","Sex differences"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"sex differences in aortic valve calcification in severe aortic valve stenosis association between computer tomography assessed calcification and valvular calcium concentrations","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85105835054","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-620473","identifier":[{"id":"85105835054","type":"scopus"},{"id":"32500142","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["sdu-a51e8757-46f0-4b15-a4dc-5b981cd804b9"],"keyword":["aortic valve calcification","aortic valve stenosis","computer tomography (CT)","sex differences"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-4C5CB1F76CDF7F70A897EEAFF0678218"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research Unit OPEN (Odense)","SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of Cardiology (Odense)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Rigshospitalet"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Louise","key":"lindepau","last":"Linde","locid":"4fc23628-00d4-466a-9e6e-269e23160481","name":"Linde, Louise","orcid":"0000-0002-7757-2571","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Rasmus","key":"carterstorchpau","last":"Carter-Storch","locid":"1fdaaa20-9ae8-40c9-9b5a-d9d7885a200b","name":"Carter-Storch, Rasmus","orcid":"0000-0002-0359-8728","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Nicolaj Lyhne","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","locid":"1589e1dd-c542-4a6e-a1f6-2efa5c8ace32","name":"Christensen, Nicolaj Lyhne","orcid":"0000-0002-4895-0588","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Kristian Altern","key":"øvrehuspau","last":"Øvrehus","locid":"aec90a0e-8351-489e-8ab9-7b0829c8f1a6","name":"Øvrehus, Kristian Altern","orcid":"0000-0003-2454-5446","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Axel Cosmus Pyndt","key":"diederichsenpau","last":"Diederichsen","locid":"d84be6bc-52bf-4710-9f66-0209cfab4f54","name":"Diederichsen, Axel Cosmus Pyndt","orcid":"0000-0002-1285-4826","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Kristian","key":"laursenpau","last":"Laursen","locid":"06c4690f-2463-4f24-88cd-feb6370c4c26","name":"Laursen, Kristian","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Pia Søndergaard","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"720c8733-d460-49d3-b394-efbecb6349cd","name":"Jensen, Pia Søndergaard","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lars Melholt","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"bf5d4e3b-cb51-4e61-a6d1-e22445213324","name":"Rasmussen, Lars Melholt","orcid":"0000-0001-5795-4794","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Jacob Eifer","key":"møllerpau","last":"Møller","locid":"5e4d3cb6-b0a0-4541-aea1-30e73f7c10b8","name":"Møller, Jacob Eifer","orcid":"0000-0003-2873-5845","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jordi Sanchez","key":"dahlpau","last":"Dahl","locid":"fa82ce60-e408-4c0f-b013-151f87c6998c","name":"Dahl, Jordi Sanchez","orcid":"0000-0002-8345-204X","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["32500142"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1093/ehjci/jeaa096","issn":["15252167","15322114"],"issn_org":["20472404"],"issue":"5","journal":"European Heart Journal Cardiovascular Imaging","pages":"581-588","publisher":"Oxford University Press","status":"p","title":"European Heart Journal Cardiovascular Imaging","title_org":"European Heart Journal - Cardiovascular Imaging","volume":"22"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85105835054"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-a51e8757-46f0-4b15-a4dc-5b981cd804b9"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Sex differences in aortic valve calcification in severe aortic valve stenosis : association between computer tomography assessed calcification and valvular calcium concentrations","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-620473","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"Relapse involving the central nervous system (CNS) is an infrequent event in the progression of mantle cell lymphoma (MCL) with an incidence of approximately four percent. We report four cases of MCL with CNS relapse. In three of the four patients a large chromosomal copy-number alteration (CNA) of 1q was demonstrated together with TP53 mutation/deletion. These patients experienced brief response to ibrutinib, whereas a fourth patient harboring mutated ATM demonstrated a long-term effect to ibrutinib and no CNA. Although it is unclear whether chromosome 1q CNA contribute to specific phenotypes these reports may be of value as such lesions are uncommon features of MCL.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Hansen, Marcus Høy","Juul-Jensen, Karen","Cédile, Oriane","Kavan, Stephanie","Møller, Michael Boe","Christensen, Jacob Haaber","Nyvold, Charlotte Guldborg"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-625833"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Hansen, Marcus Høy"],"keyword":["Copy number alteration","Mantle cell lymphoma"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"distal chromosome 000000000001q aberrations and initial response to ibrutinib in central nervous system relapsed mantle cell lymphoma","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.lrr.2021.100255","version":"Published Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["We thank professor Mads Thomassen, Department of Clinical Genetics, Odense University Hospital, Denmark, for the assistance in relation to Next-generation sequencing. Also, we are grateful for the support provided by the foundations Grosserer Brogaard og Hustrus Mindefond, Dagmar Marshalls Fond, A. J. Andersen og hustrus Fond, and Eva og Henry Fr?nkels Mindefond."],"id":"S01-000.00-625833","identifier":[{"id":"85107309950","type":"scopus"},{"id":"34150491","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC8190481","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["sdu-b77d657a-3951-452e-9559-d3956d2d4a7d"],"keyword":["Central nervous system relapse","Chromosome 1 aberration","Copy number alteration","Ibrutinib response","Mantle cell lymphoma"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-D8D8A391960A06C95E334CCD27988AAC"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/183507627/1_s2.0_S2213048921000224_main_1_.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.lrr.2021.100255","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of Haematology (Odense)","SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of Pathology (Odense)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Marcus Høy","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"066dac5b-cbf5-4b70-b136-3e5dd42e4bee","name":"Hansen, Marcus Høy","orcid":"0000-0003-3083-4850","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Karen","key":"juuljensenpau","last":"Juul-Jensen","locid":"bbcd089b-e5fb-4195-b1cd-6b31fe740f04","name":"Juul-Jensen, Karen","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Oriane","key":"cédilepau",