yngpau","last":"Forman","locid":"ddfe2814-4ae0-463d-9748-c1ba0647b469","name":"Forman, Julie Lyng","orcid":"0000-0001-7368-0869","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Lars Thorbjørn","key":"jensenlarsthorbjørnpau","last":"Jensen","name":"Jensen, Lars Thorbjørn","rank":13,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Jacob Eifer","key":"møllerjacobeiferpau","last":"Møller","locid":"5e4d3cb6-b0a0-4541-aea1-30e73f7c10b8","name":"Møller, Jacob Eifer","orcid":"0000-0003-2873-5845","rank":14,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Morten","key":"schoumortenpau","last":"Schou","name":"Schou, Morten","rank":15,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["33357505"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/s2213-8587(20)30382-x","issn":["22138587","22138595"],"issn_org":["22138587"],"issue":"2","journal":"The Lancet Diabetes & Endocrinology","pages":"106-116","publisher":"UniCeSV - Universita degli Studi di Firenze","status":"p","title":"The Lancet Diabetes & Endocrinology","title_org":"The Lancet Diabetes and Endocrinology","volume":"9"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85099024223"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Region Zealand","Region of Southern Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-f2de0824-4050-4f0c-a4a9-171d521684fa","ku-ceeece28-456d-47e7-89ed-800893829a96","sdu-7949133b-a4ee-48b5-8d0a-cacdf9325be5"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Effects of empagliflozin on estimated extracellular volume, estimated plasma volume, and measured glomerular filtration rate in patients with heart failure (Empire HF Renal) : a prespecified substudy of a double-blind, randomised, placebo-controlled trial","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S03-099.80-011601","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"BACKGROUND: There are limited data on outcomes of moderate to severe coronavirus disease 2019 (COVID-19) among patients treated with remdesivir and dexamethasone in a real-world setting. We sought to compare the effectiveness of standard of care (SOC) alone versus SOC plus remdesivir and dexamethasone. METHODS: Two population-based nationwide cohorts of individuals hospitalized with COVID-19 during February through December 2020 were studied. Death within 30 days and need of mechanical ventilation (MV) were compared by inverse probability of treatment weighted (ITPW) logistic regression analysis and shown as odds ratio (OR) with 95% confidence interval (CI). RESULTS: The 30-days mortality rate of 1694 individuals treated with remdesivir and dexamethasone in addition to SOC was 12.6% compared to 19.7% for 1053 individuals receiving SOC alone. This corresponded to a weighted OR of 30-day mortality of 0.47 (95% CI: .38-.57) for patients treated with remdesivir and dexamethasone compared to patients receiving SOC alone. Similarly, progression to MV was reduced (OR 0.36; 95% CI: .29-.46). CONCLUSIONS: Treatment of moderate to severe COVID-19 during June through December that included remdesivir and dexamethasone was associated with reduced 30-day mortality and need of MV compared to treatment in February through May.","author_count":31,"contributors":["Benfield, Thomas","Bodilsen, Jacob","Brieghel, Christian","Harboe, Zitta Barrella","Helleberg, Marie","Holm, Claire","Israelsen, Simone Bastrup","Jensen, Janne","Jensen, Tomas Østergaard","Johansen, Isik Somuncu","Johnsen, Stine","Madsen, Birgitte Lindegaard","Lundgren, Jens","Meyer, Christian Niels","Mohey, Rajesh","Pedersen, Lars Møller","Nielsen, Henrik","Nielsen, Stig Lønberg","Obel, Niels","Omland, Lars Haukali","Podlekareva, Daria","Poulsen, Birgitte Klindt","Ravn, Pernille","Sandholdt, Haakon","Starling, Jonathan","Storgaard, Merete","Søborg, Christian","Søgaard, Ole Schmeltz","Tranborg, Torben","Wiese, Lothar","Christensen, Hanne Rolighed"],"cuid":["S04-094.37-009082"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":4,"corresponding_author":["Benfield, Thomas"],"keyword":["Adenosine Monophosphate analogs derivatives","Alanine analogs derivatives","Antiviral Agents therapeutic use","COVID 19 drug therapy","Cohort Studies","Covid 19","Dexamethasone","Dexamethasone therapeutic use","Humans","Pneumonia","Remdesivir","Retrospective Studies","SARS CoV 2","Survival"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA"],"OT":["Esbjerg og Grindsted Sygehus"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"improved survival among hospitalized patients with coronavirus disease 000000002019 covid 000000000019 treated with remdesivir and dexamethasone a nationwide population based cohort study","src":["aau","au","ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC8344480/pdf/ciab536.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S04-094.37-009082","identifier":[{"id":"PMC8344480","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"000735309500161","type":"wos"},{"id":"85122546522","type":"scopus"},{"id":"34111274","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["aau-bc568715-6744-4cb0-88bc-727cf3594f2a","au-23a7e33b-b8c5-45d2-874c-08e1b882b79a","ku-ae3ad4a8-52e7-4742-aeeb-2d0c717b42a1","sdu-602f10fd-a7bb-4879-ae11-16f97bdb9a37"],"keyword":["Adenosine Monophosphate/analogs & derivatives","Alanine/analogs & derivatives","Antiviral Agents/therapeutic use","COVID-19","COVID-19/drug therapy","Cohort Studies","Dexamethasone/therapeutic use","Humans","Retrospective Studies","SARS-CoV-2","dexamethasone","pneumonia","remdesivir","survival"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-7-E782FBF81712CB1C30C3BB5C65AA647A"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC8344480/pdf/ciab536.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC8344480/","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Internal medicine: infection medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Department of Infectious Diseases","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Klinik Medicin og Akut"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"north denmark region","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-NDR","l3nl":"North Denmark Region","l3nn":"North Denmark Region","loc":["De