st":"Hassager","locid":"49196e5d-0f61-44b2-a6b9-cd6c5f8f3bc2","name":"Hassager, Christian","orcid":"0000-0002-1199-0981","rank":19,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["30286032"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1097/shk.0000000000001191","issn":["10732322","15400514"],"issn_org":["10732322"],"issue":"3","journal":"Shock","pages":"321-327","publisher":"Lippincott Williams and Wilkins","status":"p","title":"Shock","volume":"51"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85061511943"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-45148671-9ebf-49bb-af0f-6598c18c4b3d","sdu-dd259ad1-b696-44b0-8c43-85bd59886b7e"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Lactate is a Prognostic Factor in Patients Admitted With Suspected ST-Elevation Myocardial Infarction","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-100.00-041973","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"BACKGROUND AND PURPOSE: Neuroinflammation has been proposed as part of the pathogenesis of post-concussion symptoms (PCS), but the inflammatory response of the human brain to mild traumatic brain injury (mTBI) remains unknown. We hypothesized that a neuroinflammatory response is present in mTBI at 1-2 weeks post-injury and persists in patients with PCS. METHODS: We scanned 14 patients with mTBI without signs of structural damage at 1-2 weeks and 3-4 months post-injury and 22 healthy controls once using the single photon emission computed tomography tracer 123 I-CLINDE, which visualizes translocator protein (TSPO), a protein upregulated in active immune cells. PCS was defined as three or more persisting symptoms from the Rivermead Post Concussion Symptoms Questionnaire at 3 months post-injury. RESULTS: Across brain regions, patients had significantly higher 123 I-CLINDE binding to TSPO than healthy controls, both at 1-2 weeks after the injury in all patients (P = 0.011) and at 3-4 months in the seven patients with PCS (P = 0.006) and in the six patients with good recovery (P = 0.018). When the nine brain regions were tested separately and results were corrected for multiple comparisons, no individual region differed significantly, but all estimated parameters indicated increased 123 I-CLINDE binding to TSPO, ranging from 2% to 19% in all patients at 1-2 weeks, 13% to 27% in patients with PCS at 3-4 months and -9% to 17% in patients with good recovery at 3-4 months. CONCLUSIONS: Neuroinflammation was present in mTBI at 1-2 weeks post-injury and persisted at 3-4 months post-injury with a tendency to be most pronounced in patients with PCS.","author_count":13,"contributors":["Ebert, S E","Jensen, Peter","Ozenne, Brice","Armand, S","Svarer, C","Stenbaek, D S","Møller, Kirsten","Dyssegaard, A","Thomsen, G","Steinmetz, Jacob","Forchhammer, Birgitte","Knudsen, Gitte Moos","Pinborg, Lars H."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-420914"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"molecular imaging of neuroinflammation in patients after mild traumatic brain injury a longitudinal 000000000123 i clinde single photon emission computed tomography study","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-420914","identifier":[{"id":"31002206","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85066128313","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-2e19b1f2-8030-409e-a42c-8259d4077180"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-964261A403B264F7F0918DF565C5AB35"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2019","yearSub":"2019"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Dermatovenerology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen University Hospital - Rigshospitalet"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"S E","key":"ebertpau","last":"Ebert","name":"Ebert, S E","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"P","k