{"abstract":"Neutron macromolecular crystallography (NMX) has the potential to provide the experimental input to address unresolved aspects of transport mechanisms and protonation in membrane proteins. However, despite this clear scientific motivation, the practical challenges of obtaining crystals that are large enough to make NMX feasible have so far been prohibitive. Here, the potential impact on feasibility of a more powerful neutron source is reviewed and a strategy for obtaining larger crystals is formulated, exemplified by the calcium-transporting ATPase SERCA1. The challenges encountered at the various steps in the process from crystal nucleation and growth to crystal mounting are explored, and it is demonstrated that NMX-compatible membrane-protein crystals can indeed be obtained.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Sørensen, Thomas Lykke Møller","Hjorth-Jensen, Samuel John","Oksanen, Esko","Andersen, Jacob Lauwring","Olesen, Claus","Møller, Jesper Vuust","Nissen, Poul"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-167407"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Sweden"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","European Spallation Source ERIC"],"keyword":["Structural biology"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"membrane protein crystals for neutron diffraction","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"https://journals.iucr.org/services/authorrights.html","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.au.dk/ws/files/231006686/membrane_protein_crystals_for_neutron_diffraction_op5obwe0hqdwcbqp0rw2ye5tcrbmxxaq.pdf","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-167407","identifier":[{"id":"85059497526","type":"scopus"},{"id":"30605135","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-42dcf40e-6cdb-4e15-b946-a367c65e2ad3"],"keyword":["SERCA1","membrane-protein crystallization","neutron macromolecular crystallography","structural biology"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-4D6E9189B8A1837CF441412A090B6285"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"https://journals.iucr.org/services/authorrights.html","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.au.dk/ws/files/231006686/membrane_protein_crystals_for_neutron_diffraction_op5obwe0hqdwcbqp0rw2ye5tcrbmxxaq.pdf","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Interfaculty Centre, DANDRITE, DANDRITE - Nissen Group","Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Department of Molecular Biology and Genetics, Department of Molecular Biology and Genetics - Neurobiology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"se","key":"european spallation source eric","loc":["Sweden","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"European Spallation Source ERIC","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Thomas Lykke Møller","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","locid":"7afeb7bd-5eee-4b1f-ba8f-48782792c006","name":"Sørensen, Thomas Lykke Møller","orcid":"0000-0003-3873-3499","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Samuel John","key":"hjorthjensenpau","last":"Hjorth-Jensen","locid":"af62fa05-5a43-4deb-bba1-61c24d26782e","name":"Hjorth-Jensen, Samuel John","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Esko","key":"oksanenpau","last":"Oksanen","name":"Oksanen, Esko","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jacob Lauwring"