{"abstract":"A new potassium tetraamidoboranealuminate, K[Al(NH2BH3)4], has been synthesized by a mechanochemical reaction between KAlH4 and NH3BH3. The compound, K[Al(NH2BH3)4], crystallizes in a triclinic unit cell with space group symmetry P-1. The crystal structure consists of [K(NH2BH3)6]5 - octahedra which facilitate the bridging between K+ in 1D chains, while also bridging K+ to Al3+ to connect the 1D chains in a 3D network. Thermal analysis reveals that K[Al(NH2BH3)4] decomposes in two exothermic steps at T ~ 94 and 138 °C and releases primarily hydrogen. The total gas release amounts to ~6.0 wt% H2. The decomposition products are investigated ex situ by powder X-ray diffraction, infrared spectroscopy, and 11B and 27Al NMR and identified as KBH4 and amorphous phases, possibly BN3, N2BH, and/or NBH2 whereas aluminum is found in four-, five-, and six-fold coordination. Unfortunately, the decomposed sample shows no hydrogen absorption at T = 260 °C and p(H2) = 110 bar.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Møller, Kasper Trans","Jørgensen, Mathias","Andreasen, Jacob Ginnerup","Skibsted, Jørgen","Łodziana, Zbigniew","Filinchuk, Yaroslav","Jensen, Torben René"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-145778"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Jensen, Torben René"],"country":["Belgium","Poland"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Polish Academy of Sciences","Universite Catholique de Louvain"],"keyword":["Ammonia borane","Hydrogen storage"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"synthesis and thermal decomposition of potassium tetraamidoboranealuminate k al nh sub 000000000002 sub bh sub 000000000003 sub sub 000000000004 sub","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85035361765","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-145778","identifier":[{"id":"85035361765","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-1cb7d1c9-a0b0-473b-b685-557753f5669d"],"keyword":["Ammonia borane","Hydrogen storage","Metal amidoboranes","Potassium alanate","Potassium tetraamidoboranealuminate"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-3C9A5F941139D79525FE5BA0B2399908"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Interdisciplinary Nanoscience Center, Interdisciplinary Nanoscience Center - INANO-Kemi, Langelandsgade"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"pl","key":"polish academy of sciences","loc":["Poland","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Polish Academy of Sciences","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"be","key":"universite catholique de louvain","loc":["Belgium","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Universite Catholique de Louvain","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Kasper T.","key":"møllerpau","last":"Møller","locid":"a0126e94-4bb1-46c4-9692-5269054851d7","name":"Møller, Kasper Trans","name_org":"Møller, Kasper T.","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Mathias","key":"jørgensenpau","last":"Jørgensen","locid":"32e93198-01d2-4718-84d6-d305f21bff00","name":"Jørgensen, Mathias","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jacob G.","key":"andreasenpau","last":"Andreasen","locid":"cb49c3d5-2a34-4517-b706-ee0c047b58da","name":"Andreasen, Jacob Ginnerup","name_org":"Andreasen, Jacob G.","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jørgen","key":"skibstedpau","last":"Skibsted","locid":"861c686f-c84f-4ad0-8581-c8e4fe22bdf9","name":"Skibsted, Jørgen","orcid":"0000-0003-1534-4466","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Zbigniew","key":"łodzianapau","last":"Łodziana","name":"Łodziana, Zbigniew","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Yaroslav","key":"filinchukpau","last":"Filinchuk","name":"Filinchuk, Yaroslav","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Torben R.","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"e0750478-df89-45bf-aa48-b6a86de93fa0","name":"Jensen, Torben René","name_org":"Jensen, Torben R.","orcid":"0000-0002-4278-3221","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2017.11.080","issn":["03603199","18793487"],"issn_org":["03603199"],"issue":"1","journal":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","pages":"311-321","publisher":"Elsevier Ltd","status":"p","title":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","volume":"43"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85035361765"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-1cb7d1c9-a0b0-473b-b685-557753f5669d"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Synthesis and thermal decomposition of potassium tetraamidoboranealuminate, K[Al(NH<sub>2</sub>BH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>4</sub>]","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-145778","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"Background Obstruction of the left ventricular outflow tract (LVOT) as seen in hypertrophic cardiomyopathy is a dynamic condition with a wide range of clinical presentations and symptoms. Case summary We report the use of veno-arterial extracorporeal membrane oxygenation in a female patient who was resuscitated after out-of-hospital cardiac arrest. Soon after admission the patient developed critical haemodynamic compromise due to severe obstruction of the left ventricle outflow tract and systolic anterior motion (SAM) of the mitral valve. Veno-arterial extracorporeal membrane oxygenation restored haemodynamics and was weaned after 4 days without any haemodynamic compromise due to SAM. The patient was discharged from the intensive care unit at Day 13, and after 3 days at the coronary care unit, she was discharged to ambulatory follow-up with no sequelae. Discussion Veno-arterial extracorporeal membrane oxygenation restored haemodynamic stability in this patient with dynamic severe LVOT obstruction following cardiac arrest.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Stolzenburg Oxlund, Christina","Poulsen, Mikael Kjær","Jensen, Peter Blom","Veien, Karsten Tange","Møller, Jacob Eifer"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-577985"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Stolzenburg Oxlund, Christina"],"keyword":["Case report","Veno arterial extracorporeal membrane oxygenation"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a case report haemodynamic instability due to true dynamic left ventricular outflow tract obstruction and systolic anterior motion following resuscitation reversal of haemodynamics on supportive veno arterial extracorporeal membrane oxygenation","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1093/ehjcr/yty134","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-577985","identifier":[{"id":"85073610753","type":"scopus"},{"id":"PMC6426033","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"31020210","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["sdu-10b3cf08-b0fa-4d06-8186-a185201e0418"],"keyword":["Case report","Mitral regurgitation (MR)","Obstruction of the left ventricle outflow tract","Systolic anterior motion (SAM)","Veno-arterial extracorporeal membrane oxygenation"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-B1A4375ED7A14BEAB4599FDACA08DAE1"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/161320312/yty134.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1093/ehjcr/yty134","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of Cardiology (Odense)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Christina Stolzenburg","key":"oxlundpau","last":"Oxlund","locid":"7668aad3-b2d1-4b8f-8a19-71c8fdf4bca7","name":"Stolzenburg Oxlund, Christina","name_org":"Oxlund, Christina Stolzenburg","orcid":"0009-0000-7655-7276","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Mikael Kjær","key":"poulsenpau","last":"Poulsen","locid":"a8da3614-e99d-403f-933f-f5dfab3976af","name":"Poulsen, Mikael Kjær","orcid":"0000-0003-4051-7197","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Peter Blom","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"76077178-6724-41f7-a7a7-e03476ec8e8d","name":"Jensen, Peter Blom","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Karsten Tange","key":"veienpau","last":"Veien","locid":"3fa0fbe1-7c93-4cac-8f07-f07d10148c2f","name":"Veien, Karsten Tange","orcid":"0000-0002-3898-9331","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jacob Eifer","key":"møllerpau","last":"Møller","locid":"5e4d3cb6-b0a0-4541-aea1-30e73f7c10b8","name":"Møller, Jacob Eifer","orcid":"0000-0003-2873-5845","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["31020210"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1093/ehjcr/yty134","issn":["25142119"],"issue":"4","journal":"European Heart Journal - Case Reports","paperid":"yty134","publisher":"Oxford University Press","status":"p","title":"European Heart Journal - Case Reports","volume":"2"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85073610753"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-10b3cf08-b0fa-4d06-8186-a185201e0418"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"A case report : Haemodynamic instability due to true dynamic left ventricular outflow tract obstruction and systolic anterior motion following resuscitation: Reversal of haemodynamics on supportive veno-arterial extracorporeal membrane oxygenation","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-577985","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"Wooden breast (WB) abnormalities of broilers compromise the quality of fresh and processed meat. Yet, no standardised classification method for evaluating WB currently exists. We here provide a novel classification method to determine the severity of WB by palpation. Data were evaluated by one-way anova. The classification method proved robust and reliable to classify broiler filets into three distinct categories (no, moderate and severe WB). This was supported by histological findings, demonstrating less muscle tissue in WB-affected samples. Moreover, moisture content, resistance to compression, mobile water fraction, drip loss and cooking loss, as well as intramuscular and surface pH also increased with WB. Using the classification method, we demonstrated that severe WB increased the diversity of the endogenous microflora and promoted growth of Enterobacteriaceae. In conclusion, the presented classification method correlates with known meat quality traits and will be a valuable tool for future studies on WB.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Jensen, Line","Rasmussen, Martin Krøyer","Bertram, Hanne Christine S.","Jensen, Jens Askov","Møller, Hanne Søndergård","Aaslyng, Margit D.","Hejbøl, Eva K.","Pedersen, Jacob R.","Elsser-Gravesen, Dieter","Young, Jette F"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-023635"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"corresponding_author":["Young, Jette F"],"keyword":["Histology","Microbiology","Poultry","Texture","muscle tissue","scoring method","severity grading"],"level":"sci","mra":["med","sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-OT","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"GTS":["DI-GTS-ALL","DI-GTS-DTCI"],"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-GTS-DTCI","DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"classification of wooden breast myopathy in chicken pectoralis major by a standardised method and association with conventional quality assessments","src":["au","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85048570900","version":"Other Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["The authors would like to thank Prof. Henrik Daa Schrøder, Odense University Hospital, for sharing his excellent knowledge of muscle histology. Lars O. Blaabjerg from Danish Meat Research Institute is thanked for excellent technical assistance. This work was supported by The Danish Poultry Production Levy Fund. The funding source was not involved in the study design, in the collection, analysis and interpretation of data, in the writing of the report or in the decision to submit the article for publication."],"id":"S02-100.00-023635","identifier":[{"id":"85048570900","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-96b03e70-87f9-41cd-a6e5-8641d58aca6b","sdu-f87d01fb-6d3f-4f14-b528-bcf175be6e7a"],"keyword":["Histology","microbiology","muscle tissue","poultry","scoring method","severity grading","texture"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science","Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-F1123354CCAD2E2D85A5F1AB379459E5"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Public Health, Department of Public Health - Sport Science","Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Department of Food Science, Department of Food Science - Differentiated & Biofunctional Foods"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"danish technological institute","l2":"DI-GTS","l2n":"GTS Institutes","l3":"DI-GTS-DTCI","l3nn":"Danish Technological Institute","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Danish Technological Institute","namevar":["Danish Meat Research Institute"],"nora_code":"DI-GTS-DTCI","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of Pathology (Odense)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"4","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Unspecified organisation"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"dk","key":"other companies","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-OTH","l3nl":"Other Companies","l3nn":"Other Companies","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Other Companies","namevar":["Danpo A/S"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-OTH","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Line B.","key":"dalgaardpau","last":"Dalgaard","locid":"e136f41f-f605-4357-a0fb-258e8f7a10fc","name":"Jensen, Line","name_org":"Dalgaard, Line B.","orcid":"0000-0001-7676-5323","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Martin Krøyer","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"c5259478-eeef-4bbd-8dff-462bdefc04e3","name":"Rasmussen, Martin Krøyer","orcid":"0000-0002-1889-2874","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Hanne C.","key":"bertrampau","last":"Bertram","locid":"9ad2a927-38d2-4267-9382-a851bf3c7e06","name":"Bertram, Hanne Christine S.","name_org":"Bertram, Hanne C.","orcid":"0000-0002-1882-5321","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jens A.","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"d17ed28c-3024-4e70-be9f-913580f0500a","name":"Jensen, Jens Askov","name_org":"Jensen, Jens A.","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Hanne S.","key":"møllerpau","last":"Møller","locid":"ee4bfcda-2bdc-4dd6-90cc-3c3d00e2dbad","name":"Møller, Hanne Søndergård","name_org":"Møller, Hanne S.","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Margit D.","key":"aaslyngpau","last":"Aaslyng","name":"Aaslyng, Margit D.","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Eva K.","key":"hejbølpau","last":"Hejbøl","locid":"a1436b7e-a7e8-40fe-9f65-7595dfccbb2f","name":"Hejbøl, Eva Kildall","name_org":"Hejbøl, Eva K.","orcid":"0000-0002-3462-321X","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4 5","corresponding":null,"first":"Jacob R.","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","name":"Pedersen, Jacob R.","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 4 5","corresponding":null,"first":"Dieter","key":"elssergravesenpau","last":"Elsser-Gravesen","locid":"0dfb98dc-1f45-47b4-a940-aef4d5422998","name":"Elsser-Gravesen, Dieter","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jette F.","key":"youngpau","last":"Young","locid":"93e1c32a-23c8-4141-8799-56c91ff992a2","name":"Young, Jette F","name_org":"Young, Jette F.","orcid":"0000-0002-8809-9513","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1111/ijfs.13759","issn":["09505423","13652621"],"issn_org":["09505423"],"issue":"7","journal":"International Journal of Food Science and Technology","pages":"1744-1752","publisher":"Wiley","status":"p","title":"International Journal of Food Science and Technology","title_org":"International Journal of Food Science & Technology","volume":"53"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85048570900"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All GTS Institutes","All Miscellaneous","All Private Research","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-GTS-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","GTS Institutes","Miscellaneous","Other Companies","Other Research","Private Research","Universities","University of Southern Denmark","danpo a/s","isi food protection aps"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-96b03e70-87f9-41cd-a6e5-8641d58aca6b","sdu-f87d01fb-6d3f-4f14-b528-bcf175be6e7a"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Classification of wooden breast myopathy in chicken pectoralis major by a standardised method and association with conventional quality assessments","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-100.00-023635","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"Aims: Anthracycline-based chemotherapy improves survival in breast cancer patients but is associated with increased risk of heart failure (HF). However, the risk of late-onset HF is debatable and mainly based on observational studies. The aim of this study was to evaluate the effect of anthracycline-based chemotherapy on long-term risk of clinical HF. Methods and results: Between 1990 and 1998 the Danish Breast Cancer Cooperative Group (DBCG) 89D trial randomized 980 Danish women with early breast cancer to adjuvant cyclophosphamide, epirubicin, and fluorouracil or cyclophosphamide, methotrexate, and fluorouracil. Incident HF was the primary endpoint obtained from Danish administrative registries. Follow-up ended at December 2014. The risk of HF was evaluated in a cumulative incidence analysis and a Fine–Gray proportional hazards model. Median follow-up time was 16.9 years [interquartile range (IQR) 3.7–20.9]. In the epirubicin treatment group, 23 new cases of HF were identified vs. 9 in the non-epirubicin group corresponding to incidence rates per 1000 patient-years of 3.7 [95% confidence interval (CI) 2.5–5.6] vs. 1.4 (95% CI 0.7–2.7). The cumulative incidence of HF was higher in the epirubicin treatment group compared with the non-epirubicin group (P < 0.01), yielding a hazard ratio of 3.00 (95% CI 1.39–6.49, P < 0.01) for HF associated with epirubicin. The median dose of epirubicin was 451.9 mg/m 2 (IQR 400.0–523.5). Conclusions: Anthracycline-based chemotherapy is associated with a three-fold increased risk of late-onset clinical HF relative to non-anthracycline chemotherapy in this randomized clinical trial, but overall risk is low.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Banke, Ann","Fosbøl, Emil L","Møller, Jacob E","Gislason, Gunnar H","Andersen, Mads Jønsson","Bernsdorf, Mogens","Jensen, Maj-Britt","Schou, Morten","Ejlertsen, Bent"],"cuid":["S03-099.86-029966"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":3,"corresponding_author":["Banke, Ann"],"keyword":["Adult","Aged","Anthracycline","Antibiotics Antineoplastic adverse effects","Breast Neoplasms diagnosis","Cardio oncology","Cardiotoxicity","Chronic heart failure","Denmark epidemiology","Disease Free Survival","Female","Follow Up Studies","Forecasting","Heart Failure chemically induced","Humans","Incidence","Long term follow up","Middle Aged","Retrospective Studies","Risk Factors","Survival Rate trends"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-NP","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR"],"NP":["DI-NP-ALL","DI-NP-HJER"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-NP-HJER","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"long term effect of epirubicin on incidence of heart failure in women with breast cancer insight from a randomized clinical trial","src":["au","ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85042594109","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S03-099.86-029966","identifier":[{"id":"85042594109","type":"scopus"},{"id":"29493047","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-eec1f191-86bf-42dd-b567-a66c52b517df","ku-601339d5-7642-4c27-9861-6228c9b9361a","sdu-c9dee511-62e0-4f6a-8184-015761f100a1"],"keyword":["Adult","Aged","Anthracycline","Antibiotics, Antineoplastic/adverse effects","Breast Neoplasms/diagnosis","Cardio-oncology","Cardiotoxicity","Chronic heart failure","Denmark/epidemiology","Disease-Free Survival","Epirubicin/adverse effects","Female","Follow-Up Studies","Forecasting","Heart Failure/chemically induced","Humans","Incidence","Long-term follow-up","Middle Aged","Retrospective Studies","Risk Factors","Survival Rate/trends"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"n