{"abstract":"One unreported case of extended-spectrum-beta-lactamase (ESBL)-producing Salmonella enterica serovar Typhi was identified, whole-genome sequence typed, among other analyses, and compared to other available genomes of S. Typhi. The reported strain was similar to a previously published strain harboring blaSHV-12 from the Philippines and likely part of an undetected outbreak, the first of ESBL-producing S. Typhi.","author_count":15,"contributors":["Hendriksen, Rene S.","Leekitcharoenphon, Pimlapas","Mikoleit, Matthew","Jensen, Jacob Dyring","Kaas, Rolf Sommer","Roer, Louise","Joshi, Heena B.","Pornruangmong, Srirat","Pulsrikarn, Chaiwat","Gonzalez-Aviles, Gladys D.","Reuland, E. Ascelijn","Al Naiemi, Nashwan","Wester, Astrid Louise","Aarestrup, Frank Møller","Hasman, Henrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-311109"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Asia, South","Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Netherlands","Norway","Thailand","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Centers for Disease Control and Prevention","Norwegian Institute of Public Health","Thailand Ministry of Public Health","VU University Medical Centre"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"genomic dissection of travel associated extended spectrum beta lactamase producing salmonella enterica serovar typhi isolates originating from the philippines a one off occurrence or a threat to effective treatment of typhoid fever","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1128/JCM.03104-14","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-311109","identifier":[{"id":"84921783012","type":"scopus"},{"id":"25428145",