","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-379363","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
{"abstract":"A Danish football club has established a (24/7/365) football training facility, where the authors developed an interactive training installation (http://vimeo.com/28446312). The training installation consist of a 12*12 m square with 4 M­Station Pro rebounders equipped with sensors that enable hit position sensing. The rebounders are equipped with loudspeakers and lights being used to call for the ball. Here we discuss one game “Pass ­and ­Turn”, which is meant to train speed in controlling a returned ball, reaction to a call for the ball and turning to hit rebounders to the left, right, behind or the same.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Jensen, Mads Møller","Grønbæk, Kaj","Rasmussen, Majken Kirkegård","Thomassen, Nicolaj","Andersen, Jacob","Nielsen, Jesper"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-181459"],"event":{"end":"2013-06-22","place":"Istanbul, tr","start":"2013-06-19","title":"International Symposium on Computer Science in Sports","year":"2013"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"GTS":["DI-GTS-ALL","DI-GTS-ALX"],"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-GTS-ALX","DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"interactive football training based on rebounders with hit position sensing and audio light feedback","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-181459","ids":["au-5b715af9-1f15-4acc-a3fa-fb59ea017bc3"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-A28889C71C037AB094FBF5B7B35A67C4"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namev